EN:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}What do you think of my place?{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}
If you see anything you really like, I
could let you have it...{{TAG:000F:0005:15002800}}
Gimme!
Nah, that's OK.

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Allora? Che ne pensi di casa mia?{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}
Se vedi qualche cosa che ti piace,
posso vendertela...{{TAG:000F:0005:15002800}}
Interessante!
Naaah, non importa.

DE:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Na, wie findest du mein Häuschen?{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}
Wenn dir hier drin was besonders
gefällt, kannst du es gerne haben!{{TAG:000F:0005:15002800}}
Au fein!
Ach nee, lass mal.

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Evimi nasıl buldun?{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}
Çok hoşuna giden bir şey görürsen
sana verebilirim...{{TAG:000F:0005:15002800}}
Ver bana!
Yok, gerek yok.

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}My place is pretty cool, huh?{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}
You can take a little slice of
coolness home if you like!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0000:}}If there's something in here you like,
I can sell it to you!{{TAG:000F:0005:15002800}}
I like something!
Nah, I'm OK...

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Evim bayağı havalı, değil mi?{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}
İstersen bu havalılıktan küçük
bir parçayı eve götürebilirsin!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0000:}}Burada hoşuna
giden bir şey varsa sana satabilirim!{{TAG:000F:0005:15002800}}
Bir şey beğendim!
Yok, iyiyim...

ES:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Je, je, je{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Oye, ¿te gusta mi casa?{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
{{TAG:0003:0015:}}¿No te gustaría llevarte algo
de recuerdo a la tuya?
{{TAG:0003:0000:}}Si ves algo que te guste
mucho, te lo podría regalar,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
{{TAG:0005:0007:}}.{{TAG:000F:0005:15002800}}
Me interesa algo
No te preocupes

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Ah ah ah{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Beh, ti piace casa mia?{{TAG:0007:0001:}} {{TAG:0003:0015:}}
Magari c'è qualcosa che vorresti
comprare...
{{TAG:0003:0000:}}Se vedi qualcosa che ti ispira,
dimmelo, te lo posso vendere,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
{{TAG:0005:0007:}}.{{TAG:000F:0005:15002800}}
Qualcosa c'è.
Niente di interessante.

Dimmi un po' cosa vuoi comprare,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
{{TAG:0005:0007:}}.{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0009:}}Attenzione però:{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} le cose a cui tengo
moltissimo non sono in vendita.

TRANSLATION:
Ne istediğini söyle,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
{{TAG:0005:0007:}}.{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0009:}}Ama{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} çok bağlandığım bir şeyse
sana satamayabilirim.
